				{
					"id": 200140201,
					"content": "魔物全都被打倒啦，你可真厉害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 200140202,
					"content": "冒险手册上面写的果然没错，可以使用各种方式来打倒魔物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 200140203,
					"content": "不过…说实话，离这些魔物这么近，我还是有些害怕…幸好有你陪着我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 200140204,
					"content": "你还得多多训练。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200140205,
					"content": "嗯，我知道。要成为冒险家可不是一件容易的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 200140206,
					"content": "谢谢你旅行者，我先回去城里啦。出来这么长时间，我哥哥又要着急了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 200140207,
					"content": "今后的训练，我得再努力一点才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				}
